OL,4,Ashown in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains
OL,7,Fdistressing details
OL,9,FA mother accused of murdering her
OL,10,Fone-year-old daughter recorded videos
OL,11,Fpleading with the child to wake up
OL,12,Fafter she suffered fatal injuries, a
OL,13,Fcourt has heard.
OL,15,FJurors were shown footage recorded by
OL,16,FKinga Wydrzynska in the early hours of
OL,17,F7 January 2025, before emergency
OL,18,Fservices were called to the family home
OL,19,Fin Rugby, Warwickshire.
